      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1554486876508160
    m_Localized: You can navigate the screen with the W-A-S-D keys
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1554596477865984
    m_Localized: You can move it by holding down the right mouse button
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1554614278492160
    m_Localized: You can find the cats with a left mouse click.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1554639259766784
    m_Localized: You can get help by pressing ''H'' or the hint button in the upper
      left
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1554657253330944
    m_Localized: Congratulations, you can now switch to painting mode at this stage!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1554669383258112
    m_Localized: The palette will help you with your painting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1554685136063936
    m_Localized: Or you can select and paint by pressing and holding.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1554703000604672
    m_Localized: You are now ready to paint and find cats. Have fun!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2453087265820672
    m_Localized: "Other maps will be available in the full\_version."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
